## Development

```bash
uv run prek run --all-files --hook-stage manual   # every check{% if ci != "none" %}, as CI runs it{% endif %}
uv run --group docs zensical serve                # docs at http://localhost:{{ '8001' if monorepo else '8000' }}
```

{% if has_python -%}
Commits run lint, formatting and types, and check that the message is a [Conventional Commit](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/); pushes run the tests and the docs build. Test order is random; replay a failure with `uv run pytest -p randomly --randomly-seed=<seed>`.
{%- else -%}
Commits run lint, formatting and types, and check that the message is a [Conventional Commit](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/); pushes run the tests, the production build and the docs build.
